    "changes": [],
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Starships_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy</a></i></p><p><b>Emplacement Points:</b>&nbsp;2</p><p><b>Size Restriction:</b> Colossal or Larger</p><p>Cryogenic Chambers are hibernation systems that allow live creatures to be carried in stasis. Originally developed prior to the invention of safe <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hyperdrive\" title=\"Hyperdrive\">Hyperdrive</a> systems, they are now used to haul herds of livestock (often Nerf or Bantha herds) and to transport critically injured passengers. Each unit of Cryogenic Chambers can carry a number of Medium or smaller creatures equal to (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cost_Modifier_(SotG)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cost Modifier (SotG)\">Cost Modifier</a>)/5. Large creatures take up five times as much space, and Huge creatures take up twenty times as much space.</p>",
